### Reset
POST http://localhost:8080/demo/reset

### Create
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
X-User: seller
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId":"C1","productId":"P1","quantity":2}

### Confirm
POST http://localhost:8080/orders/O1/confirm
X-User: seller

### Configure two failures
POST http://localhost:8080/demo/provider
Content-Type: application/json

{"temporaryFailures":2,"permanentFailure":false}

### Pay
POST http://localhost:8080/orders/O1/pay
X-User: finance

### Refund
POST http://localhost:8080/orders/O1/refund
X-User: finance

### Audit
GET http://localhost:8080/audit

### Metrics
GET http://localhost:8080/metrics

### Provider stats
GET http://localhost:8080/demo/provider

### Stock
GET http://localhost:8080/stocks/P1
